stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unlocked

    Unlocked --> Unlocked: failed login (1-4 attempts)\nfailed_attempts++
    Unlocked --> Locked: 5th consecutive failed login\nlocked_until = now + 15 min

    Locked --> Locked: login attempted before\nlocked_until elapses (denied)
    Locked --> Unlocked: successful login after\nlocked_until elapses\n(failed_attempts reset to 0)

    Unlocked --> Unlocked: successful login\n(failed_attempts reset to 0)

    note right of Locked
        Implements SRS 4.2 Robustness:
        "lock out any user account for
        15 minutes after 5 consecutive
        failed login attempts"
        (AuthenticationController.login)
    end note
